abstract: >-
  Resolutive Science v0.1.1 is a metadata and archival interoperability patch
  for the v0.1.0 Cosmology Foundation scientific snapshot. No scientific
  results, equations, datasets, conclusions, or evidentiary claims are changed
  from v0.1.0. This patch corrects citation metadata for Zenodo archival while
  preserving the scientific content and provenance of the original release.
